			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jakelazaroff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jakelazaroff</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://ruby.social/@konnorrogers\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>konnorrogers</span></a></span> </p><p>A mixture of generated classes and inline styles? OMFG, I'm so not surprised it's on Bluesky. <a href=\"https://techhub.social/tags/webdevgoals\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>webdevgoals</span></a> <a href=\"https://techhub.social/tags/webdevwtf\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>webdevwtf</span></a> <a href=\"https://techhub.social/tags/webdevfail\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>webdevfail</span></a> <a href=\"https://techhub.social/tags/ReactNative\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>ReactNative</span></a></p>",
